    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "af0f6c086f9f6e8b643cb5f79ddd93de",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"checks-before-choosing-a-numerical-point\">Checks before choosing a numerical point</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both diagrams and their interference reproduce the complete massive references.</li>\n<li>Photon and gluon Ward contractions vanish in every channel.</li>\n<li>Gluon references along the quark or virtual photon give the same current contraction.</li>\n<li>Exact crossing includes the fermion sign and changed incoming color averages.</li>\n<li>The massless spacelike-photon limits agree with the reference formulas.</li>\n<li>Shared flux and two-body phase space supply the real-photon angular rates.</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Write <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(F(s,t,u)||)</marimo-tex> for the fusion current contraction. With the same invariant\narguments, annihilation gives <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((N_c^2-1)F/(2N_c^2)||)</marimo-tex>; crossing <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s\\leftrightarrow u||)</marimo-tex>\ngives the Compton current with factor <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-(N_c^2-1)/N_c||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
